  "name": "bitflags",
  "description": "A high-performance Rust macro library designed to generate type-safe, C-style bitmask structures. It provides a robust DSL for defining bitflags that automatically implement standard bitwise operators and common traits while ensuring memory efficiency through direct integer mapping. The generated structures facilitate seamless interop with low-level C APIs and hardware registers by encapsulating raw bit manipulation within a safer, idiomatic interface.",
